                    // Mirrors the normal forward-tick sequence: pre_tick →
                    // writeInputToMemory → reset_audio + RNG sync →
                    // stepOneFrame → feedAudio → post_tick. Wrapped in try
                    // so a pre_tick/input failure falls back to the next
